# The frontend build contexts are now the repo root (needed so frontend-shared/
# is available at the ../frontend-shared path frontend-*/tsconfig.json expects).
# Keep the context lean by excluding everything the frontend builds don't need.
#
# `docs` is deliberately NOT excluded: the docs image (docs/Dockerfile) also builds from the repo
# root, because mkdocs.yml lives there and references docs/hooks.py. It is only ~750 KB, and the
# `**/node_modules` rule above already keeps any future `npm install` under docs/ out of every
# context — which is what made this directory 361 MB before.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/site
docs/build
docs/.docusaurus
backend
contracts
daml
indexer
gateway
monitoring
examples
deploy
docker
.git
